{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-algorithms","title":"图算法：最短路、中心性与社区发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications/graph-algorithms","wordCount":1733,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图算法-最短路-中心性与社区发现\">图算法：最短路、中心性与社区发现</h1><p>把数据存成图只是开始，真正把结构变成洞察的是在图上跑算法。同一片节点和边，最短路算法能告诉你「怎么连最近」，中心性算法能告诉你「谁最关键」，社区发现算法能告诉你「谁和谁抱团」。这三类算法构成了欺诈识别、推荐系统、供应链分析背后的共同引擎。这一篇讲清它们各自回答什么问题、原理是什么、复杂度几何。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图算法和前面讲的遍历是有分工的：遍历是在查询时顺手沿边走几步（见 <a href=\"../modeling/traversal-patterns\">遍历模式</a>），而图算法通常是对全图或大子图做系统性的迭代计算，往往运行在专门的图分析引擎里（如 Neo4j 的 GDS 库）。三大经典家族分别从「距离」「重要性」「聚集」三个角度刻画图的结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[图算法三大家族] --&gt; B[路径搜索]&#10;  A --&gt; C[中心性]&#10;  A --&gt; D[社区发现]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[Dijkstra 加权最短路]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[A* 启发式]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[度中心性]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[介数中心性]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[PageRank]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[Louvain 模块度]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[标签传播]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[连通分量]\">graph TD\n  A[图算法三大家族] --&gt; B[路径搜索]\n  A --&gt; C[中心性]\n  A --&gt; D[社区发现]\n  B --&gt; B1[Dijkstra 加权最短路]\n  B --&gt; B2[A* 启发式]\n  C --&gt; C1[度中心性]\n  C --&gt; C2[介数中心性]\n  C --&gt; C3[PageRank]\n  D --&gt; D1[Louvain 模块度]\n  D --&gt; D2[标签传播]\n  D --&gt; D3[连通分量]</pre><p>三类算法的定位与复杂度量级可先汇总成表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>家族</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>代表算法</th>\n<th>复杂度量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径搜索</td>\n<td>两点间怎么连最优</td>\n<td>Dijkstra、A*</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((V+E)\\log V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心性</td>\n<td>谁是关键节点</td>\n<td>PageRank、介数中心性</td>\n<td>迭代 / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(VE)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区发现</td>\n<td>谁和谁抱成一团</td>\n<td>Louvain、标签传播</td>\n<td>近线性（启发式）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路径搜索-从最短跳数到最优成本\">路径搜索：从最短跳数到最优成本</h2><p>无权图上的最短路就是 BFS（已在 <a href=\"../modeling/traversal-patterns\">遍历模式</a> 介绍）。但现实里的边往往带权重——距离、耗时、费用、风险，此时要找的不是「最少跳数」而是「最小总成本」，这就需要更强的算法。</p>\n<p><strong>Dijkstra 算法</strong>是加权最短路的经典解。它从起点出发，用一个优先队列每次取出当前已知成本最小的节点向外松弛，逐步确定到各节点的最短成本，要求边权非负。借助二叉堆实现，复杂度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((V+E)\\log V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是节点数与边数。<strong>A* 算法</strong>在 Dijkstra 基础上引入启发函数（比如地图上到目标的直线距离），优先朝目标方向扩展，在单源单汇场景下能大幅减少访问节点数，是导航类应用的主力。这类算法广泛用于路径规划、网络路由、供应链最优路径，也是社交产品里「你和某人之间最短的人脉链」的底层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中心性-谁是网络里的关键节点\">中心性：谁是网络里的关键节点</h2><p>中心性回答一个直觉但极有价值的问题：在这张网里，谁举足轻重？不同的「重要」定义催生了不同算法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>度中心性</strong>最朴素：一个节点的连接数。粉丝多的账号、转账对手多的账户，度中心性高。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(V+E)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但只看局部。</li>\n<li>**介数中心性（betweenness）**衡量一个节点在多少条最短路径上充当桥梁。它高的节点是「枢纽」——删掉它，网络容易断裂。它对识别关键基础设施、信息传播的咽喉极有用，但计算昂贵，精确算法约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(VE)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，大图上常用采样近似。</li>\n<li><strong>PageRank</strong>源自谷歌网页排名，思想是「被重要节点指向的节点也重要」，通过迭代直到收敛。它的更新可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PR(u) = \\frac{1-d}{N} + d \\sum_{v \\in B_u} \\frac{PR(v)}{L(v)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3998em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是阻尼系数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是指向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 的节点集、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的出度。PageRank 广泛用于影响力排序、推荐、欺诈中的可疑节点排名。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>中心性分析是欺诈识别与影响力营销的核心工具，常和后面的产品生态（见 <a href=\"graph-products\">产品生态：Neo4j、TigerGraph 与 Neptune</a>）里的图分析库配合使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"社区发现-找出抱团的子群\">社区发现：找出抱团的子群</h2><p>社区发现要找的是图里「内部连接稠密、彼此连接稀疏」的节点群——朋友圈、利益团伙、商品同购簇。它无需预先知道有几个社区，是典型的无监督结构发现。</p>\n<p><strong>Louvain 算法</strong>是最流行的方法，基于「模块度」（modularity）这个度量社区划分质量的指标，通过贪心地反复把节点并入能最大提升模块度的社区、再把社区收缩成超级节点迭代，速度快、效果好，能处理百万级节点的图。**标签传播算法（LPA）**更简单：每个节点初始持有唯一标签，反复把自己更新为邻居中最多的标签，直到稳定，近线性时间但结果有随机性。<strong>连通分量</strong>则是最基础的「谁和谁可达」分组，常作数据清洗与预处理。</p>\n<p>社区发现在欺诈中能揪出协同作案的账户团伙，在推荐中能发现兴趣相近的用户群，在 <a href=\"knowledge-graphs-graphrag\">知识图谱与 GraphRAG</a> 里则被用来把大图切成主题子图、为大模型提供分层摘要——这是 2024 年微软 GraphRAG 方法的关键一招。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从算法到落地-图分析引擎\">从算法到落地：图分析引擎</h2><p>这些算法很少手写实现，而是调用成熟的图数据科学库。Neo4j 的 GDS（Graph Data Science）提供了上述全部算法的优化实现并能在内存投影图上高效运行；TigerGraph 内置了丰富的图算法库并主打大规模并行；Amazon Neptune Analytics 也提供了一批内建分析算法。这些产品的具体取舍见 <a href=\"graph-products\">产品生态</a>。</p>\n<p>实践中的常见流水线是：用 OLTP 图库（如事务型的 Neo4j 实例）承载实时读写，定期把子图投影到分析引擎跑 PageRank、Louvain 等重算法，再把算法结果（中心性分数、社区标签）写回图作为节点属性，供后续查询使用。这样既不让重算法阻塞在线查询，又能让分析结果反哺业务。理解了这三类算法能产出什么，你就能把图数据库从「存储与查询」推进到「分析与决策」——这正是图技术创造商业价值的临门一脚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图算法对全图做系统计算，与查询时顺手的遍历分工不同，通常运行在专门的图分析引擎里。</li>\n<li>路径搜索：Dijkstra 求非负权最短成本路约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((V+E)\\log V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，A* 用启发函数加速，用于导航与最优路径。</li>\n<li>中心性：度中心性看连接数，介数中心性找桥梁节点（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(VE)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，大图采样），PageRank 迭代算影响力。</li>\n<li>社区发现：Louvain 基于模块度贪心合并、可扩展到百万节点，标签传播简单近线性，连通分量做基础分组。</li>\n<li>算法成果（中心性分数、社区标签）常写回图作节点属性，反哺查询；社区发现也是 GraphRAG 分层摘要的关键。</li>\n<li>落地靠成熟库（Neo4j GDS、TigerGraph 算法库、Neptune Analytics），典型流水线是投影子图跑算法再写回。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图算法：最短路、中心性与社区发现","id":"图算法-最短路-中心性与社区发现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"路径搜索：从最短跳数到最优成本","id":"路径搜索-从最短跳数到最优成本"},{"level":2,"text":"中心性：谁是网络里的关键节点","id":"中心性-谁是网络里的关键节点"},{"level":2,"text":"社区发现：找出抱团的子群","id":"社区发现-找出抱团的子群"},{"level":2,"text":"从算法到落地：图分析引擎","id":"从算法到落地-图分析引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/internals/indexing-graphs"},"next":{"title":"产品生态：Neo4j、TigerGraph 与 Neptune","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/graph-databases/applications/graph-products"}}